.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
target
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/data
**/.data
# Host-local build artifacts, never image inputs. Without these every local
# `up --build` ships ~490 MB of Terraform provider binaries and would bake a
# local state file into a layer.
**/.terraform
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
**/.wrangler
# The repo flake's direnv checkout (nix store material).
**/.direnv
tools/deploy/.env
docs
*.md
!README.md

# Training lessons are application build inputs, not repository documentation.
!apps/training/docs/**/*.md
